      "49. SMART Assignment Template\nTask or outcome:\n[What result is required?]",
      "Specific deliverable:\n[What must be produced?]",
      "Success measure:\n[How will completion and effectiveness be evaluated?]",
      "Resources and authority:\n[What tools, budget, information, and decision rights are available?]",
      "Relevance:\n[Which customer or business priority does this support?]",
      "Owner:\n[One accountable person.]",
      "Deadline:\n[Exact date, time, and time zone.]",
      "Check-in:\n[When will progress or blockers be reviewed?]\n50. Decision Record Template\nDecision required:\n[What must be decided?]",
      "Problem being solved:\n[Describe the underlying problem without assuming the solution.]",
      "Options considered:\n[Option A, B, C.]",
      "Evidence:\n[What do we know? What remains uncertain?]",
      "Recommendation:\n[Preferred option and rationale.]",
      "Decision owner:\n[Who makes the final call?]",
      "Decision:\n[What was chosen?]",
      "Implementation owner:\n[Who is responsible for execution?]",
      "Due date:\n[Exact date and time.]",
      "Review point:\n[When will the result be assessed?]\n51. Problem-Escalation Template\nProblem:\n[What happened?]",
      "Impact:\n[Who or what is affected?]",
      "Urgency:\n[What happens if no action is taken?]",
      "Likely causes:\n[What evidence supports each possibility?]",
      "Options:\n[Available actions and trade-offs.]",
