      "Support needed:\n[What decision, resource, or authority is required?]\n52. Hiring Scorecard\nCategory\tScore (1–5)\tEvidence to record\nKnown candidate\t\tDirect references or observed work\nProven experience\t\tRelevant work and outcomes\nProven industry\t\tMarket and operating knowledge\nProven problem set\t\tEvidence of solving the actual problem\nProven scale\t\tExperience at comparable complexity\nTotal\t/25",
      "Work sample:\n[What task will demonstrate the required capability?]",
