      "Hiring decision:\n[Decision and rationale.]\n53. Meeting Close Template\nBefore ending the meeting, record:\n- Decision: What did we agree?\n- Owner: Who is accountable?\n- Deliverable: What exactly will be produced?\n- Deadline: When is it due?\n- Dependencies: What must happen first?\n- Review: When will we check the result?\n54. Key-Person Dependency Audit\nCritical function\tCurrent owner\tBackup owner\tDocumented process?\tRisk if unavailable\tNext action\nCustomer relationships\nSales pipeline\nFinance and reporting\nProduct or service delivery\nHiring and onboarding\nOperations and fulfilment\nTechnology and access"
